  patterns, "type":"custom","name":"X", or symbols like "ImageGenTool",
  "WebSearchTool", "ChronicleTool", "MemoryTool")
     List items in (b) but not (a). Those are shadow tools. For each, give:
  confirmed name, evidence (file:line in strings or asar bundle), and likely
  category (web/file/agent/memory/etc).

