     - URL or endpoint it would be called against (cross-reference yesterday's
  r2 endpoint catalog and any "originator: codex_cli_rs" gates)
     - Required headers (originator, oai-product-sku, anything else the CLI
  reveals)
     - Request body shape if discoverable from the asar bundle or strings
     - Whether it has been seen on the wire in any of the on-disk logs (yes/no,
