  reasoning_content deltas + reasoning_details.summary deltas
  - Route to analysis channel in our existing ChannelCapture (drop-in compatible
   with Harmony channels)
  - Stitch by (requestId, choice.index) like the tool-call deltas
  - Add /debug/cot route showing reassembled CoT per request, filterable by
  client/model
  - Re-process the existing events.ndjson to backfill the 12 KB already captured

  Want me to build this? ~120 lines, drops into the existing channel
  architecture.

